      'class SpoolNotifier:\n' +
      '    """The deployed notifier.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '    Worth noticing where its text comes from: this adapter imports\n' +
      '    :func:`permits.services.review_service.render_decision_letter` to build the body, so an\n' +
